<td id="S4.F7.3.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.06145v1/13.png" id="S4.F7.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:329/137;" width="329" height="137" alt="Refer to caption"></td></tr>
